# night-cafe-1 (the zelynic raw-binary law): a raw compiled binary is a
# local build/extract product, never tracked. The tracked lane for a
# vendored verification package is the .gz package with its .b3sum
# sidecar (docs/VERIFY_RELEASE.md section 5). The fuzz seed fixtures
# under fuzz/seeds/ are 5-10 byte escape-sequence test data consumed by
# the validator tests - tracked on purpose.
/cosmostrix
/scripts/labs-exp/cosmostrix-*
!scripts/labs-exp/cosmostrix-*.gz
!scripts/labs-exp/cosmostrix-*.b3sum
